sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator as Platform operator
    participant UI as Billing/subscription UI
    participant API as NestJS platform API
    participant Catalog as Plan and subscription service
    participant Control as Control-plane database
    participant Usage as Usage and entitlement evaluator
    participant Tenant as Tenant API request

    Operator->>UI: Select plan, trial, status, or override
    UI->>API: Submit platform-authenticated mutation
    API->>Catalog: Validate plan version and transition
    Catalog->>Control: Persist subscription/override with audit data
    Control-->>Catalog: Effective subscription state
    Catalog->>Usage: Invalidate or recompute entitlement snapshot
    Usage-->>API: Effective limits and feature decisions
    API-->>UI: Show current plan and usage
    Tenant->>Usage: Evaluate feature or usage limit
    Usage->>Control: Read platform-owned entitlement state
    Control-->>Usage: Versioned limits and overrides
    Usage-->>Tenant: Allow, deny, or return upgrade-required response

    Note over Catalog,Usage: Entitlements are enforced server-side; UI visibility is not authorization.